Exit code: 0
---
Stdout:
ST201  Schema-violating request accepted
checks negative_data_rejection

Schema-violating request accepted.

`Invalid component:` in the failure names the broken constraint. For GraphQL, an
invalid query must get an `errors` entry, whatever the status. A rejection with
a status outside the list, such as `410` or `413`, can be allowed for the
operation:

  # schemathesis.toml
  [[operations]]
  include-name = "POST /orders"
  checks.negative_data_rejection.expected-statuses = [
    "400", "401", "403", "404", "405", "406", "409", "415", "422", "428", "429",
    "5xx", "410",
  ]

`--exclude-checks negative_data_rejection` turns it off.
